  "releaseNotes": "Conformance and completeness. fn:sum over a non-numeric item now raises err:FORG0006 (was XPTY0004), matching the Functions and Operators spec — so an xsl:try/catch on err:FORG0006 catches it. The FLWOR while clause is now evaluated (it previously raised at plan time); a while clause stops the tuple stream on the first false condition. Schema validation of a string via the ISchemaProvider default now parses and delegates to node-based validation. Requires PhoenixmlDb.Core 1.2.0. Backward-compatible; no public API removed. See RELEASES.md for full notes.",
